TITLE:: ProbeSpectrogram
summary:: Real-time scrolling audio spectrogram with ring-buffer blit
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/Probe, Classes/ProbeSpectrogramView, Classes/ProbeWaterfall, Classes/ProbeSpectrum

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeSpectrogram provides a high-performance, real-time scrolling audio spectrogram.
It utilizes a preallocated 2D raster with circular ring-buffer blit (via Pen.drawImage) to achieve sub-millisecond redraws without garbage collection overhead. Frequency bands are mapped through the active ProbeTheme color palette LUT.

list::
## Subscribes to shared link::Classes/ProbeSpectrumSource:: via link::Classes/ProbeBroker::
## Frequency axis tick markings (40 Hz to 18 kHz)
## Freeze (Space) and Clear ('c') keyboard controls
## Dynamic palette theming across all ProbeTheme palettes
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates and displays a new ProbeSpectrogram window.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target link::Classes/Server:: (defaults to code::Server.default::).

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus index to analyze (default 0).

ARGUMENT:: numBands
Number of logarithmic frequency bands (default 64, clipped 16..128).

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme name symbol (e.g. code::\graphite::) or link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: instance.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Analysis update rate in Hz (default 20 Hz).

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: window
Returns the underlying link::Classes/Window::.

METHOD:: spectrogramView
Returns the underlying link::Classes/ProbeSpectrogramView::.

METHOD:: theme
Update active theme dynamically.

ARGUMENT:: aTheme
Theme symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme::.

METHOD:: fontScale
Get or set the active typography scaling factor.

ARGUMENT:: aScale
Float font scale between 0.6 and 2.5.

METHOD:: toggleFreeze
Toggle pause/unpause of the scrolling spectrogram.

METHOD:: clear
Clear the raster display buffer.

METHOD:: close
Close the window and release broker subscriptions.

EXAMPLES::

code::
s.boot;
x = { Saw.ar(SinOsc.kr(0.2).range(100, 3000)) * 0.2 }.play;
v = Probe.spectrogram(s, 0, 64, \graphite);
::
